{
  "_readme": "Every quantum hardware price Q-Lab uses. Each entry names the page it was copied from and the day it was checked. Amounts are in the entry currency. Billing models: task_shot = per_task_usd + shots x per_shot_usd for each task; gate_shot = shots x (1q gates x usd_per_1q_gate_shot + 2q gates x usd_per_2q_gate_shot), never less than min_usd_per_task; time_based = QPU seconds x per_second; per_minute = simulated minutes x per_minute (min_seconds billed at least); free = no charge; not_public = the provider publishes no price, so no estimate is given. Update an entry by checking its source page and changing verified_on. price_check records the URL that scripts/check_prices.py last read for the entry and the day it read it; the Provider Price Check workflow runs that script every week and fails when a published price differs from this table. Entries older than 30 days are flagged as stale in every estimate.",
